### ==================== 修改密码测试 (POST /user/changePassword) ====================
### 使用说明：先运行 loginTest.http 获取 token，填入下方变量

@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. 正常修改密码
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "phone": "10000000001",
  "oldPassword": "123",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 2. 未登录 — 无 token
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "10000000001",
  "oldPassword": "123",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 3. 假 token — token 无效
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: fakeToken123456

{
  "phone": "10000000001",
  "oldPassword": "123",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 4. 缺少 phone 字段
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "123",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 5. 缺少 oldPassword 字段
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "phone": "10000000001",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 6. 缺少 newPassword 字段
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "phone": "10000000001",
  "oldPassword": "123"
}

### 7. phone 为空字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "phone": "",
  "oldPassword": "123",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 8. oldPassword 为空字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "phone": "10000000001",
  "oldPassword": "",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 9. 旧密码错误
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "phone": "10000000001",
  "oldPassword": "wrongPassword",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 10. 新密码格式不合法 — 太短
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "phone": "10000000001",
  "oldPassword": "123",
  "newPassword": "123"
}

### 11. 手机号格式错误
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "phone": "12345",
  "oldPassword": "123",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 12. 手机号不属于当前用户
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "phone": "13900000000",
  "oldPassword": "123",
  "newPassword": "abc123"
}

### 13. 空请求体
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{}

### 14. 用新密码重新登录 — 验证修改成功
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "10000000001",
  "password": "abc123"
}